Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:49.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:56.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:02.24,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It is not something you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You will find it inside anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:08.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Love is the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:14.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sorrow and strife
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.62,0:23:20.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}May cloud the blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.17,0:23:26.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The overlapping warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:32.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Becomes a light to illuminate the world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:38.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:42.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:45.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:47.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.11,0:23:50.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}But a dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.95,0:23:54.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
